---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/workspaces.css';
---
<Layout
  title="主题工作区"
  active="workspaces"
  description="围绕一个问题，组织阅读路径、对照文章，让知识形成自己的连接。"
>
  <section class="shell ws-page">
    <header class="ws-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">FOLLOW A THREAD OF CURIOSITY</span>
        <h1>让想法，<br />在这里<span>相遇。</span></h1>
        <p>
          围绕一个问题，把散落的知识编成一条线。<br />循序阅读、并置思考，也给新的连接留一点空间。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ws-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span>✳</span><i></i><b>IDEAS, IN ORBIT</b></div>
    </header>
    <div class="ws-layout">
      <aside class="ws-sidebar">
        <div class="ws-sidebar-heading">
          <h2>我的主题</h2>
          <span id="ws-count">—</span>
        </div>
        <button id="ws-new" class="button button-primary" type="button">
          新建主题 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
        </button>
        <nav id="ws-list" aria-label="主题列表"><p>正在读取主题…</p></nav>
        <button id="ws-retry" class="button" type="button" hidden>重新读取主题</button>
        <p class="ws-sidebar-note">
          一个主题，一段专注的探索。<br />你的阅读顺序与问题会随账号保存。
        </p>
      </aside>
      <div class="ws-main">
        <p id="ws-status" class="ws-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
          正在准备你的思考空间…
        </p>
        <section id="ws-welcome" class="ws-welcome" hidden>
          <span aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
          <p class="eyebrow">A SPACE FOR THE NEXT QUESTION</p>
          <h2>从一个好问题开始。</h2>
          <p>
            新建一个主题，加入值得一起读的文章。<br />你的阅读路径、问题清单与连接画布，会在这里慢慢生长。
          </p>
        </section>
        <section id="ws-editor" hidden aria-label="主题工作区">
          <div class="ws-editor-top">
            <span class="eyebrow">YOUR RESEARCH, CONNECTED</span>
            <div class="ws-actions">
              <button id="ws-discard" type="button" class="quiet-link" hidden>放弃本地修改</button
              ><button id="ws-delete" type="button" class="quiet-link" hidden>删除主题</button
              ><button id="ws-save" type="button" class="button button-primary">保存主题</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="sr-only" for="ws-title">主题标题</label
          ><input
            id="ws-title"
            class="ws-title"
            maxlength="320"
            placeholder="为这次探索起个名字"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <label class="sr-only" for="ws-description">主题说明</label
          ><textarea
            id="ws-description"
            class="ws-description"
            maxlength="8000"
            rows="2"
            placeholder="你想理解什么？写下一点背景，给未来的自己。"
          ></textarea>
          <div id="ws-conflict" class="ws-alert" hidden role="alert">
            <strong>这个主题已在另一处更新。</strong>
            <p>
              你的本地编辑仍在页面中。重新读取会放弃本地编辑；重新应用会用本地内容替换最新版本。
            </p>
            <div>
              <button id="ws-reload" type="button" class="button">放弃本地编辑并读取最新版本</button
              ><button id="ws-reapply" type="button" class="button">将本地编辑应用到新版本</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="ws-delete-confirm" class="ws-alert" hidden>
            <p>删除后无法恢复这个主题；主题内的文档会继续保留。</p>
            <button id="ws-delete-yes" type="button" class="button">确认删除主题</button
            ><button id="ws-delete-no" type="button" class="button">取消删除</button>
          </div>
          <div class="ws-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="主题视图">
            <button
              id="ws-tab-path"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="true"
              aria-controls="ws-view-path"
              data-ws-view="path"
            >
              阅读路径</button
            ><button
              id="ws-tab-compare"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-controls="ws-view-compare"
              tabindex="-1"
              data-ws-view="compare"
            >
              文章对照</button
            ><button
              id="ws-tab-canvas"
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              aria-controls="ws-view-canvas"
              tabindex="-1"
              data-ws-view="canvas"
            >
              连接画布
            </button>
          </div>
          <section id="ws-view-path" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ws-tab-path">
            <div class="ws-section-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">01 / READING PATH</span>
                <h2>先读什么，再想什么。</h2>
              </div>
              <span id="ws-path-count" class="ws-count"></span>
            </div>
            <ol id="ws-reading-path" class="ws-reading-path"></ol>
            <div class="ws-add">
              <label for="ws-document-search">搜索可加入的文档</label
              ><input
                id="ws-document-search"
                type="search"
                placeholder="搜索文章或草稿标题…"
                autocomplete="off"
              />
              <div id="ws-picker" class="ws-picker"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ws-section-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">02 / OPEN QUESTIONS</span>
                <h2>带着问题往下读。</h2>
              </div>
              <span id="ws-question-count" class="ws-count"></span>
            </div>
            <ul id="ws-questions" class="ws-questions"></ul>
            <form id="ws-question-form" class="ws-question-form">
              <label class="sr-only" for="ws-question">新问题</label
              ><input
                id="ws-question"
                maxlength="2000"
                placeholder="记下一个问题，或下一步探索…"
              /><button type="submit" class="button">添加问题</button>
            </form>
          </section>
          <section id="ws-view-compare" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ws-tab-compare" hidden>
            <div class="ws-section-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">SIDE BY SIDE / FIND THE DIFFERENCE</span>
                <h2>把两种视角，放在一起。</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="ws-guide">对照只读取已发布正文。草稿和未发布修改不会出现在这里。</p>
            <div class="ws-compare-selectors">
              <label>左侧文章<select id="ws-compare-left"></select></label
              ><label>右侧文章<select id="ws-compare-right"></select></label>
            </div>
            <div id="ws-comparison" class="ws-comparison" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </section>
          <section id="ws-view-canvas" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="ws-tab-canvas" hidden>
            <div class="ws-section-heading">
              <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">IDEAS IN RELATION</span>
                <h2>让阅读路径，长成一幅图。</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="ws-guide">
              连线表示你安排的阅读顺序。拖动卡片整理位置，或聚焦卡片后使用方向键（Shift
              加速）。整理后点击「保存主题」。
            </p>
            <div class="ws-canvas-scroll">
              <div id="ws-canvas" class="ws-canvas" aria-label="阅读路径连接画布"></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
    import "../scripts/workspaces/index";
  </script>
</Layout>
